的感受。<br />现在陷入了僵局，分也不是很好，父母都见过了，不分把确实有点膈应。<br />平时其实相处各方面还可以，性格学历比较好，外貌也比较出众。<br />但温柔就是很爱逃避问题也非常软弱，但我觉得也不应该牺牲我的感受。<br /><br />见父母对方母亲喝酒基本上把我数落了二十分钟，基本都在骂。。哎，对方家人很不好相处。", "last_modified": 1792051696, "replies": 145, "id": 1249080}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11906, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2516, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 415184, "username": "lrtzzzzzz", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/lrtzzzzzz", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ab82bf6435d60d63326d2140701b2bb?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ab82bf6435d60d63326d2140701b2bb?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ab82bf6435d60d63326d2140701b2bb?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1558667117, "last_modified": 1792043123, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "jchonc", "last_touched": 1792088726, "title": "教老婆开车应该注意什么", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1249011", "created": 1792043214, "deleted": 0, "content": "如题，老婆看她同事会开车了，也想学着开一下，她学完驾照 7 ～ 8 年没摸过车了，\r\n我先让她看看科目一和科目二的考题拖延一下，但感觉拖不了多久了😂；\r\n我自己也就开了 2w 公里才～～", "content_rendered": "如题，老婆看她同事会开车了，也想学着开一下，她学完驾照 7 ～ 8 年没摸过车了，<br />我先让她看看科目一和科目二的考题拖延一下，但感觉拖不了多久了😂；<br />我自己也就开了 2w 公里才～～", "last_modified": 1792043214, "replies": 142, "id": 1249011}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_large.png?m=1644885960", "name": "car", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_normal.png?m=1644885960", "title": "汽车", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/